---
import EnglishSiteLayout from "../../layouts/EnglishSiteLayout.astro";
---
<EnglishSiteLayout
  title="Advertising and collaborations | Canapalandia"
  description="Advertising, sponsored content, editorial collaborations and partnership enquiries for Canapalandia."
  canonical="/en/advertising/"
  alternateIt="/pubblicita/"
>
  <article class="en-page">
    <header>
      <p class="eyebrow">Advertising & partnerships</p>
      <h1>Work with Canapalandia transparently.</h1>
      <p class="lead">We consider advertising, sponsored projects, guest contributions and partnerships when they are relevant to the audience and clearly separated from independent editorial work.</p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>What we evaluate</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Clearly labelled advertising placements.</li>
        <li>Sponsored content with explicit commercial disclosure.</li>
        <li>Editorial collaborations that add useful expertise or original information.</li>
        <li>Partnerships related to hemp, CBD, sustainability, research, policy and adjacent sectors.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Editorial independence</h2>
      <p>A commercial relationship does not buy a favourable editorial conclusion. Sponsored or commercial material should be recognisable as such, while independent reporting remains separate.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Send a proposal</h2>
      <p>Describe the organisation, the proposed format, the objective, the relevant links and any timing requirements. We will assess fit, transparency and practical feasibility before discussing publication.</p>
      <p><a class="cta" href="/en/contact/">Contact Canapalandia →</a></p>
    </section>
  </article>
</EnglishSiteLayout>
<style>
  .en-page{max-width:820px;margin:0 auto;padding:2.5rem 0 5rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--brand);font:700 .78rem/1.2 Archivo,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.en-page h1{margin:.35rem 0 1rem;font:500 clamp(3rem,7vw,5.6rem)/.95 Newsreader,serif}.lead{font-size:1.14rem}.en-page section{margin-top:2.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:1.2rem}.en-page h2{font:500 1.9rem/1.1 Newsreader,serif}.en-page p,.en-page li{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.en-page a{color:var(--brand);font-weight:700}.cta{text-decoration:none}
</style>
